   "fen": "r1b1kb1r/1p2pppp/2n2n2/p1P5/8/N1P2N2/PP3PPP/R1BK1B1R b kq - 1 8",
   "line": [
    "Na3"
   ],
   "spoken": "The knight heads to a3 and onward to b5 — from there it eyes the c7-square and cramps Black's queenside, turning the sharp position into a lasting squeeze.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Reroute the knight via a3-b5 to hit c7 and pressure the queenside.",
   "plans": "Land the knight on b5 and press c7."
